  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Haryana HTET Exam Date 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-03T15:05:44+05:30\">June 3, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">3:05 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://bseh.org.in/home\">Board of School Education (BSEH)</a>,</strong> has released the <strong>Exam Date</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>PRT, TGT, PGT Posts.</strong> The exam will be conducted from&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"430\">04 – 05 July 2026</strong>. The&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"469\">HTET application process</strong>&nbsp;started on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"498\">24 December 2025</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their form until <strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"576\">05 January 2026</strong>. Candidates can check their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"631\">Exam Date</strong>&nbsp;using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"704\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the <strong>portal. The direct link</strong> is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download SarkariResult App Now</a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp</a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Telegram</a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">Haryana HTET Exam Date 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Haryana Teacher Eligibility Test HTET Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/haryana-htet-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Notification Date :&nbsp;<strong>24 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>24 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>05 January 2026 (Extended)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>05 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Form :&nbsp;<strong>04 – 05 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : 04 – 05 July 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Available Soon</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declared Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong>For Level One</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">General, OBC, EWS :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Other State (Including SC &amp; PH) :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SC, PH Candidates of Haryana :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong>For Level Two</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">General, OBC, EWS :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1800/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Other State (Including SC &amp; PH) :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1800/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SC, PH Candidates of Haryana :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 900/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong>For Level Three</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">General, OBC, EWS :<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 2400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Other State (Including SC &amp; PH) :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 2400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SC, PH Candidates of Haryana :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong>&nbsp;</span>You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Age Limits </h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>NA</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">NA</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download SarkariResult App Now</a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">Haryana HTET Online Form 2025 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.6377%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.3623%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.6377%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Level 1 (Primary Teacher)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.3623%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10+2 Intermediate with 50% Marks and Passed / Appearing 2 Year Diploma in Elementary Education / Special Education / B.E.Ed OR</span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10+2 Intermediate with 45% Marks and Passed / Appearing 2 Year Diploma in Elementary Education / Special Education / B.E.Ed OR</span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Any Stream and Passed / Appearing 2 Year Diploma in Elementary Education / Special Education / B.E.Ed&nbsp;</span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.6377%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Level 2 (TGT Teacher)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.3623%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Any Stream with 50% Marks and 2 Year Diploma in Elementary Education OR</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bachelor Degree with 50% Marks and B.Ed / Special B.Ed Degree OR</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10+2 with 50% Marks and 4 Year BA B.Ed / B.Com B.Ed Degree.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For More Details Read Full Notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.6377%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Level 3 (PGT Lecturer)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.3623%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Master Degree in Concerned Subject with 50% Marks and B.Ed Degree.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For Subject Wise Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download Haryana HTET Exam Date 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the <strong>official Board of School Education Haryana (BSEH)</strong> website.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, click on the <strong>“HTET Exam Date 2026”</strong> notification link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The official <strong>exam schedule PDF</strong> will open on the screen.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Check your <strong>exam date, shift timing, and examination</strong> level carefully.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download the <strong>HTET Exam Date Notice PDF</strong> for future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Take a printout of the <strong>exam schedule</strong> if required.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Haryana HTET Online Form 2025 : Mode of Selection&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Written Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Medical Examination</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>