und-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>HTET Official Website</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://bseh.org.in/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Haryana HTET Exam Date 2026 : Important Question&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> <strong data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"96\">When will the Haryana HTET Exam 2026 be conducted?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"> The HTET 2026 examination is scheduled to be held on 04 – 05 July 2026 for PRT, TGT, and PGT levels.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> <strong data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"298\">Which authority conducts the HTET Exam 2026?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The Board of School Education Haryana (BSEH) conducts the HTET examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 it